WEBVTT

00:02.160 --> 00:04.991
We should all be able to
stay in this room, right?

00:05.460 --> 00:09.510
No, this room is reserved
exclusively for the Shield Hero.

00:09.910 --> 00:13.439
But I want to stay with Master!

00:13.440 --> 00:16.300
A separate room has been
prepared for the attendants.

00:17.430 --> 00:20.210
For the upcoming schedule,

00:20.540 --> 00:23.959
after Shield Hero rests from
long journeys in this room,

00:23.960 --> 00:29.970
you will change into Siltvelt formal attire
for the evening banquet being held tonight.

00:31.260 --> 00:35.599
Before that, you'll be taking a bath first.
Once the bath is prepared,

00:35.600 --> 00:38.329
- We're being left out of everything.
- we'll come notify you.

00:38.330 --> 00:41.349
Well, there's still time
before the banquet,

00:41.350 --> 00:43.749
so shall we take a stroll around town?

00:43.750 --> 00:46.899
No, I'll wait in the room next door.

00:46.900 --> 00:50.039
So I can protect Master Naofumi
if something happens.

00:50.040 --> 00:54.530
Oh, come on! Let's go out
together with your big sister~

00:55.670 --> 00:58.249
She's right.
Go ahead, everyone.

00:58.250 --> 00:59.819
Yes!

00:59.820 --> 01:02.459
I wonder if they have any good drinks.

01:02.460 --> 01:03.729
Sounds fun!

01:03.730 --> 01:05.727
Let's go, hurry!

01:05.728 --> 01:06.089
But...

01:06.090 --> 01:07.210
However...

01:10.270 --> 01:12.340
Leave Raph-chan with me here.

01:22.400 --> 01:26.070
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

02:45.520 --> 02:47.979
EPISODE 2: A WARM WELCOME

02:47.980 --> 02:50.819
EPISODE 2: A WARM WELCOME
Judging by the way they welcomed us,

02:50.820 --> 02:53.280
this country might be more
troublesome than I thought.

02:53.620 --> 02:55.030
Right, Raph-chan?

02:59.550 --> 03:01.330
What's wrong, Raph-chan?

03:02.000 --> 03:04.480
A shield? In a place like this?

03:05.820 --> 03:07.479
SHIELD OF THE BEAST KING
The skills...

03:07.480 --> 03:08.699
SHIELD OF THE BEAST KING
"Beast Transformation Assist,"

03:08.700 --> 03:10.750
SHIELD OF THE BEAST KING
and "Territorial Reform."

03:27.850 --> 03:29.730
Looks tasty.

03:30.540 --> 03:32.480
What a lovely townscape.

03:34.440 --> 03:36.900
Welcome!

03:39.480 --> 03:44.090
It seems they genuinely
respect Master Naofumi.

03:44.700 --> 03:46.330
Master Naofumi...

03:50.680 --> 03:52.529
This looks delicious!

03:52.530 --> 03:55.589
Oh my, they have alcohol as well.

03:55.590 --> 04:00.849
Maybe Master Naofumi's territory
will become like this one day.

04:00.850 --> 04:03.189
Please call us
when you're ready to order.

04:03.190 --> 04:04.020
Yes.

04:04.800 --> 04:07.600
Huh? There's not enough water?

04:12.990 --> 04:15.879
Oh, so that's why you
didn't want to go outside?

04:15.880 --> 04:18.809
It's been like that the whole time
we were walking through town.

04:18.810 --> 04:20.820
Big brother's just too sensitive.

04:21.180 --> 04:26.499
It's wonderful that so many different
kinds of people live together...

04:26.500 --> 04:29.290
...but things like this always have two sides.

04:29.670 --> 04:34.540
That's why we need to keep
a good eye out on Naofumi's behalf.

04:43.840 --> 04:46.190
This feels so good.
Right, Raph-chan?

04:58.530 --> 04:59.989
AN APHRODISIAC HAS BEEN DETECTED

04:59.990 --> 05:01.380
Aphrodisiac?!

05:03.750 --> 05:06.300
What's going on here?!

05:14.960 --> 05:20.129
Master Shield Hero!

05:20.130 --> 05:21.470
Wait, wait, wait!

05:23.430 --> 05:24.729
Don't come here!

05:24.730 --> 05:26.510
Shooting Star Shield!

05:30.480 --> 05:32.079
Master Shield Hero!

05:32.080 --> 05:34.780
Let me wash your back!

05:35.520 --> 05:36.689
Portal Shield!

05:36.690 --> 05:37.319
'PORTAL SHIELD' HAS BEEN DISABLED
DUE TO INTERFERENCE

05:37.320 --> 05:38.900
'PORTAL SHIELD' ACTIVATION FAILED
What? Disabled?!

05:42.990 --> 05:44.549
What's wrong, Raphtalia?

05:44.550 --> 05:45.450
Master Naofumi!

05:47.870 --> 05:49.909
Alright, we should go too!

05:49.910 --> 05:51.339
I'm full~

05:51.340 --> 05:53.580
But we haven't finished our food?!

05:54.710 --> 05:55.829
Master Naofumi!

05:55.830 --> 05:57.219
Please mate with me!

05:57.220 --> 06:00.050
So this is what the Queen meant
about that prophecy...

06:01.000 --> 06:05.639
First, you will be surrounded
by princesses and noble ladies.

06:05.640 --> 06:12.559
They'll try to form a harem for you
with girls from any number of races.

06:12.560 --> 06:14.020
A harem?

06:15.330 --> 06:16.500
I see!

06:17.030 --> 06:20.529
O Dragon Vein, hear our wish!

06:20.530 --> 06:23.030
As source of thy power, I beseech thee...

06:24.000 --> 06:28.869
Decipher the laws of nature, and show our
enemies illusions that will confuse them!

06:28.870 --> 06:30.830
Emptiness is Form!

06:36.540 --> 06:38.629
Master Shield Hero~

06:38.630 --> 06:42.050
So rough!

06:44.640 --> 06:46.680
What kind of illusion are they seeing?

06:47.580 --> 06:50.999
Also, shouldn't it be 'Form is Emptiness'?

06:51.000 --> 06:53.640
Master Naofumi! Are you all—

06:55.030 --> 06:57.909
W-We came after receiving
the distress signal,

06:57.910 --> 06:59.489
but what is going on here...?

06:59.490 --> 07:02.089
You can already tell, right?
It's an emergency.

07:02.090 --> 07:03.189
Oh, my.

07:03.190 --> 07:05.849
You seem to be enjoying yourself quite a bit.

07:05.850 --> 07:07.629
They beat me to the finish line...

07:07.630 --> 07:09.950
I'm just showing them an illusion!

07:10.370 --> 07:12.060
Let's get out of here.

07:16.320 --> 07:18.080
What was the meaning of that?

07:18.550 --> 07:20.669
My deepest apologies.

07:20.670 --> 07:24.300
That was a service that has been offered
to the Shield Hero for generations,

07:24.680 --> 07:26.430
and we thought you would be pleased...

07:26.800 --> 07:28.509
Are you making fun of me?

07:28.510 --> 07:30.110
Absolutely not!

07:30.680 --> 07:32.199
I am truly, deeply sorry.

07:32.200 --> 07:34.489
I've had enough of empty apologies.

07:34.490 --> 07:36.229
If you really mean it,

07:36.230 --> 07:38.729
then prepare our ship immediately.

07:38.730 --> 07:40.560
Y-Yes, I understand.

07:40.900 --> 07:43.819
We will hold a meeting
and reach a decision shortly...

07:43.820 --> 07:45.859
If it's going to take that long,

07:45.860 --> 07:49.159
I'll just use my portal skill
and return to my village.

07:49.160 --> 07:51.089
That would be a problem!

07:51.090 --> 07:54.970
We will definitely prepare it,
so please give us some time!

07:55.400 --> 07:56.639
Fine.

07:56.640 --> 07:59.439
But if this kind of treatment continues,

07:59.440 --> 08:02.600
we'll be taking action on our end too.

08:07.320 --> 08:11.850
Can we really get to Q'ten Lo
if we count on him?

08:36.850 --> 08:40.417
Oh my, that outfit looks wonderful on him!

08:40.418 --> 08:43.509
It must be a truly splendid outfit!

08:43.510 --> 08:46.100
Please tell me the details, big brother!

08:47.270 --> 08:48.260
Ladies and gentlemen!

08:48.720 --> 08:51.959
The worship ceremony
has concluded without issue.

08:51.960 --> 08:56.060
Please enjoy the meal
and have a nice chat.

09:05.050 --> 09:07.699
I'll bring some snacks for you.

09:07.700 --> 09:09.220
Ah, thanks.

09:11.380 --> 09:13.370
I want food!

09:18.040 --> 09:21.359
Just be confident, big brother.

09:21.360 --> 09:23.430
Atla's right.

09:25.220 --> 09:28.630
Since this is a rare opportunity,
you should be confident.

09:29.080 --> 09:30.759
What opportunity?

09:30.760 --> 09:33.800
We talked about it in town, right?
That there are two sides.

09:34.390 --> 09:37.969
Even at a gathering like this meant
to honor the Shield Hero,

09:37.970 --> 09:41.389
there are definitely people
with other motives.

09:41.390 --> 09:46.670
If you focus on spotting them,
the party will be over before you know it.

09:47.470 --> 09:49.609
Could I get another drink?

09:49.610 --> 09:53.420
- People with other motives, huh...
- Oh? They have beer mugs too!

09:57.580 --> 10:02.540
Shield Hero, are you enjoying the party?

10:03.020 --> 10:06.459
You're... Jaralis, isn't it?

10:06.460 --> 10:10.510
I am deeply honored
that you remember me.

10:11.020 --> 10:13.210
About that matter we discussed...

10:17.130 --> 10:19.010
Lord Fohl, Lady Atla.

10:23.070 --> 10:24.650
We need to talk.

10:26.280 --> 10:27.469
You're...

10:27.470 --> 10:32.820
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

10:39.080 --> 10:41.999
It's been a long time, Lord Fohl.

10:42.000 --> 10:45.370
Lady Atla, you've grown so much...

10:45.680 --> 10:46.859
Ethan.

10:46.860 --> 10:49.049
Big brother, who is this?

10:49.050 --> 10:51.459
He is Ethan.
He used to serve under our father.

10:51.460 --> 10:52.719
Our father's...?

10:52.720 --> 10:53.899
Yes.

10:53.900 --> 10:57.779
You probably don't remember,
but he used to visit our house often

10:57.780 --> 10:59.930
and even played with us.

11:00.430 --> 11:05.929
After your parents passed away
and your whereabouts became unknown,

11:05.930 --> 11:08.610
I've been worried about
the two of you ever since.

11:09.260 --> 11:12.529
In this country,
the Hakuko race is treated poorly,

11:12.530 --> 11:16.599
so please forgive me for having
to meet you again like this.

11:16.600 --> 11:19.850
But there's something
I really had to tell you.

11:22.940 --> 11:25.710
Please be careful of Jaralis
of the Raio species.

11:26.130 --> 11:30.330
He may have been involved
in your father's death.

11:31.600 --> 11:33.129
Jaralis?

11:33.130 --> 11:37.109
It's said that Jaralis was present
at your father's final moments

11:37.110 --> 11:41.519
but within the military at the time,
there were rumors that the truth was different.

11:41.520 --> 11:42.350
Rumors?

11:42.660 --> 11:43.290
Yes.

11:44.040 --> 11:48.990
The situation he reported about
Lord Tyran's death was suspicious.

11:49.590 --> 11:53.260
I submitted multiple requests to the military
higher-ups for a reinvestigation, but...

11:54.230 --> 11:58.459
I've always regretted not being able to
fight alongside Lord Tyran to the end

11:58.460 --> 12:02.200
and for not being able to protect him!

12:03.530 --> 12:06.250
That's why I want to do everything I can

12:06.830 --> 12:09.390
to support you two as my way of atoning.

12:10.150 --> 12:13.440
I'll do whatever I can to help you.

12:14.110 --> 12:18.440
By the way, have your discussions
with Werner progressed?

12:19.910 --> 12:21.459
As I thought.

12:21.460 --> 12:26.350
That man is disregarding the will
of the Shield Hero, isn't he?

12:26.840 --> 12:31.719
Werner is determined
to keep you in this country.

12:31.720 --> 12:35.239
He's constantly concerned
with the mood of the citizens.

12:35.240 --> 12:36.650
The citizen's mood?

12:36.980 --> 12:40.830
Precisely because their
faith in you is strong...

12:41.820 --> 12:45.259
Saying, 'Why does the Shield Hero
only protect other countries

12:45.260 --> 12:49.119
and not Siltvelt,
which he should be protecting?'

12:49.120 --> 12:52.990
Thus, more and more citizens
are becoming dissatisfied.

12:54.090 --> 12:58.289
Werner has been cautious lately,

12:58.290 --> 13:01.100
trying to prevent such
factions from acting out.

13:01.760 --> 13:05.490
That's why, no matter
how much you press him...

13:07.050 --> 13:10.440
So please allow me to be of use.

13:10.880 --> 13:14.300
I can prepare a ship
for you immediately.

13:15.270 --> 13:18.119
Unfortunately, given my current position,

13:18.120 --> 13:20.699
I can't do it through official channels.

13:20.700 --> 13:23.829
But if it's for your sake,

13:23.830 --> 13:26.429
I don't mind getting my hands dirty.

13:26.430 --> 13:29.000
After all, it's the will of our god.

13:29.930 --> 13:36.130
Relying on me is the only way
to reach Q'ten Lo.

13:44.050 --> 13:45.870
Looks delicious!

13:46.230 --> 13:47.099
Yeah.

13:47.100 --> 13:49.770
Good morning, Shield Hero.

13:50.220 --> 13:54.389
Today, we would like you to attend
the meeting that will be held shortly.

13:54.390 --> 13:56.279
After that, you'll have lunch, and then...

13:56.280 --> 13:58.860
Yeah, yeah, I got it.
The meeting, right?

13:59.320 --> 14:03.120
We will let you know
more details later.

14:06.590 --> 14:10.729
Werner is trying to keep us in this country
by piling on pointless services

14:10.730 --> 14:13.380
and scheduling everything tight.

14:13.930 --> 14:16.810
On that point, Jaralis is right.

14:17.380 --> 14:21.840
But Jaralis himself seems fishy.

14:22.720 --> 14:26.910
From what I heard from Fohl and Atla,
he's a dangerous guy.

14:29.900 --> 14:32.580
Neither of them is trustworthy.

14:33.000 --> 14:34.170
Which means...

14:34.900 --> 14:37.230
Let us offer our prayers to the Shield Hero!

14:37.640 --> 14:40.470
It is by the will of the Shield God

14:41.030 --> 14:45.120
that we have food and life here today!

14:45.490 --> 14:49.330
May this give us strength to fulfill the will
of the god who protects the world!

14:50.740 --> 14:52.500
May this give us strength!

14:52.940 --> 14:55.709
What a beautiful prayer.

14:55.710 --> 14:59.710
First, please begin your meal, Shield Hero.

15:04.740 --> 15:05.930
In any case,

15:06.450 --> 15:11.270
it would be best to leave this
uncomfortable country as soon as possible.

15:16.610 --> 15:19.770
Then, let us begin the special meeting.

15:20.470 --> 15:25.029
The agenda is to reconsider the deployment
of forces in preparation for the next Wave,

15:25.030 --> 15:29.319
including placing the Shield Hero at
the core of our military command—

15:29.320 --> 15:30.120
Hold on.

15:30.560 --> 15:32.219
The next Wave, you say?

15:32.220 --> 15:35.749
I've told you many times that
I don't intend to stay here long.

15:35.750 --> 15:37.559
We understand that.

15:37.560 --> 15:40.219
That's precisely why we're
discussing the budget

15:40.220 --> 15:43.919
to have our nation's finest shipyard
build a ship worthy of the Hero...

15:43.920 --> 15:46.340
That's not the point.

15:48.170 --> 15:51.859
I get that you want to use me
to strengthen your military

15:51.860 --> 15:55.920
or unite the will of your people.

15:57.360 --> 16:00.359
But! Just like you want
to protect your country,

16:00.360 --> 16:02.679
I want to protect my own territory.

16:02.680 --> 16:06.030
The people in my village are waiting
for us to come back now!

16:06.650 --> 16:07.910
That's...

16:08.360 --> 16:11.879
Well, once the matters with Q'ten Lo
and the Phoenix are settled,

16:11.880 --> 16:15.300
I might be willing to act
more as the Shield Hero...

16:18.840 --> 16:20.919
That's our Hero for you!

16:20.920 --> 16:25.130
Your stance of prioritizing your territory

16:25.450 --> 16:28.849
is truly the ideal attitude
of one who leads others.

16:28.850 --> 16:31.090
I aspire to be like that as well.

16:31.580 --> 16:36.379
I too would very much
like the Hero to continue

16:36.380 --> 16:38.399
to reign and govern Siltvelt in the future.

16:38.400 --> 16:42.119
But ignoring the will
of the Shield Hero is something

16:42.120 --> 16:45.699
that the people of Siltvelt must not do.

16:45.700 --> 16:49.359
Shouldn't we expedite preparations
for the ship immediately?

16:49.360 --> 16:51.469
In this special meeting,

16:51.470 --> 16:54.369
no one outside the Four Great Races
is permitted to speak!

16:54.370 --> 16:56.990
Know your place, Jaralis!

16:58.930 --> 17:01.290
My apologies, Hero.

17:01.720 --> 17:05.357
Your opinion was very helpful.

17:05.358 --> 17:09.163
We'll take your views into account
and discuss things internally for the time being.

17:09.164 --> 17:12.163
Another postponement, huh...

17:12.164 --> 17:12.357
Another postponement, huh...
How stubborn can they be?

17:12.358 --> 17:14.836
How stubborn can they be?

17:23.260 --> 17:24.641
Master Naofumi.

17:24.642 --> 17:24.959
Oh?

17:24.960 --> 17:27.836
Let's finish this briefly
while no one's around.

17:29.300 --> 17:30.480
Shield Hero.

17:30.860 --> 17:32.110
He's Ethan.

17:32.780 --> 17:37.429
It's an honor to meet you in person.

17:37.430 --> 17:43.250
I can't thank you enough for
saving Lord Fohl and Lady Atla.

17:43.730 --> 17:46.379
I'll repay this debt, even if it costs me—

17:46.380 --> 17:47.839
That's enough.

17:47.840 --> 17:50.340
I did it on my own.

17:50.780 --> 17:53.799
More importantly,
Fohl already told you, right?

17:53.800 --> 17:56.389
Yes. You mean keeping
an eye on them, right?

17:56.390 --> 17:57.800
That's right.

17:58.250 --> 18:04.600
Werner and Jaralis might take
drastic action to break this stalemate.

18:05.240 --> 18:07.779
Report whatever you find to these two.

18:07.780 --> 18:08.599
Hi!

18:08.600 --> 18:09.939
Nice to meet you.

18:09.940 --> 18:13.200
I want to settle this within a few days.

18:17.060 --> 18:19.790
We kept a close watch on their actions,

18:20.470 --> 18:22.710
while we made preparations behind the scenes.

18:24.210 --> 18:26.830
So we'd be ready whenever
the opportunity came.

18:29.180 --> 18:33.060
And so, our days in Siltvelt went by.

18:42.020 --> 18:43.810
POISON DETECTED

18:45.770 --> 18:47.759
I don't want to eat this!

18:47.760 --> 18:51.759
Really? I'm fine with anything
as long as I get alcohol.

18:51.760 --> 18:52.469
That's because...

18:52.470 --> 18:55.629
It is by the will of the Shield God

18:55.630 --> 18:59.370
that we have food and life here today!

18:59.840 --> 19:03.909
May this give us strength to fulfill the will
of the god who protects the world!

19:03.910 --> 19:05.620
May this give us strength!

19:06.120 --> 19:08.840
And now, please enjoy your meal, Hero.

19:30.710 --> 19:33.179
Hero... This is...

19:33.180 --> 19:34.909
Just drink it!

19:34.910 --> 19:37.939
It tastes awful, but it's better
than dying from poison!

19:37.940 --> 19:38.660
Poison?!

19:40.900 --> 19:42.639
I can't believe this.

19:42.640 --> 19:45.789
To poison a god is a crime
beyond forgiveness!

19:45.790 --> 19:47.290
It is high treason!

19:48.760 --> 19:51.590
Is something the matter?
Do you need something from me?

19:52.640 --> 19:58.480
Looks like we need a discussion
you all love so much.

20:03.250 --> 20:06.399
I never imagined there's
a poison in our meal.

20:06.400 --> 20:09.149
I really thought this country was safe.

20:09.150 --> 20:12.269
It must be your doing, Jaralis!

20:12.270 --> 20:15.929
No one else here would commit
such a treacherous act!

20:15.930 --> 20:19.459
Please don't throw accusations
around without evidence.

20:19.460 --> 20:24.429
You're doing this because you're displeased
that the Hero has no intention

20:24.430 --> 20:25.999
of staying in this country, right?

20:26.000 --> 20:27.000
What did you say...?!

20:28.040 --> 20:31.210
Well, I don't care who did it.

20:31.640 --> 20:34.469
What matters is that someone
tried to poison us.

20:34.470 --> 20:36.459
That fact alone is enough.

20:36.460 --> 20:39.680
I can't cooperate with a country
like this anymore.

20:40.170 --> 20:42.130
I've already got a ship.

20:43.030 --> 20:45.429
I've had enough of dealing with you people.

20:45.430 --> 20:47.389
Please wait, Hero! I beg you...!

20:47.390 --> 20:50.139
Well, this is quite the disaster.

20:50.140 --> 20:53.479
We've angered the Shield Hero, our god,

20:53.480 --> 20:56.429
and lost our chance at mutual cooperation.

20:56.430 --> 20:59.759
This is a serious blunder, Werner.

20:59.760 --> 21:01.549
Stay out of this, Jaralis!

21:01.550 --> 21:03.989
You are always scheming with
your underhanded tricks!

21:03.990 --> 21:07.589
If you're going to accuse me
of orchestrating this incident,

21:07.590 --> 21:10.289
then present even a single
piece of evidence here!

21:10.290 --> 21:13.709
Your past actions speak for themselves!

21:13.710 --> 21:16.589
You'd do anything for power!

21:16.590 --> 21:19.049
I'm not the only one who's seen it!

21:19.050 --> 21:19.699
He's right!

21:19.700 --> 21:20.519
Yeah!

21:20.520 --> 21:21.029
You coward!

21:21.030 --> 21:21.989
Shame on you!

21:21.990 --> 21:27.409
Shifting the blame onto others just because
your own position is in jeopardy...

21:27.410 --> 21:30.980
Is that how someone who leads
the people should behave?

21:31.500 --> 21:35.599
This is what happens when you
value bloodlines above all else.

21:35.600 --> 21:40.070
There are plenty of capable individuals
outside the Four Great Races.

21:41.700 --> 21:44.029
And you're suggesting you're one of them?

21:44.030 --> 21:45.489
What did you say?

21:45.490 --> 21:48.869
- The Raio species should keep quiet!
- Jaralis is speaking the truth!

21:48.870 --> 21:52.080
- Werner is right!
- Step aside, old men!

21:52.830 --> 21:55.150
Enough, all of you!

22:01.780 --> 22:04.340
I can bear no more of this!

